# TypeScript Formatting

The repository defines Prettier configuration and formatting scripts. Follow
the repository-configured Prettier settings and circuits/tsconfig.json.

Use the repository's existing formatting script rather than inventing
configuration or formatting commands.

Keep formatting changes limited to touched files. Do not invent configuration,
reformat unrelated files, or change tooling merely to make an implementation
pass.
- Do not change line endings unnecessarily.

Formatting is a code-quality constraint, not a reason to expand task scope.
